  conditional-Madelung misses (r2-ch16y, register 1437): Mo42 Rh45 Pd46 La57 Gd64 Au79 Ac89 Th90 Cm96 Lr103 (10) — equal to S's union: True
  convention S', clause 2 restricted to a passed-over channel NEVER occupied at any Z' < Z: La57 Ac89 Th90 (3)
